        "slc_d30066a88cc830aebc13ebde33b3800c8e5cb7b1e13824d237b5ca0803d97020"
      ],
      "text": "Agents speaking pre-1.0 A2A spec versions (e.g. 0.2.x, 0.3.0) are rejected with error -32009 VersionNotSupported."
